### F-007 — High: `/api/auth/set-cookie` Bina Verification Ke Token Set Karta Hai

**SEVERITY:** High
**FILE:** `client/src/app/api/auth/set-cookie/route.ts`
**LINE:** 3-30

**Masla (Roman Urdu):**
Yeh Next.js API route koi bhi string body mein receive karta hai aur use JWT cookie ki tarah set kar deta hai — bina yeh check kiye ke token genuine hai ya nahi. Koi bhi attacker apna bana hua fake token POST kar sakta hai aur system use valid samajh leta hai.

**Anjam (Consequences):**
- Attacker kisi bhi user ka impersonation kar sakta hai — sirf ek forged string bhej ke
- ADMIN account ka bhi fake token set kiya ja sakta hai
- Ye ek complete authentication bypass hai

**Current (Vulnerable):**
```ts
const { token } = await request.json();
if (!token) { ... }
// Koi signature check nahi — koi bhi string accept ho jati hai!
response.cookies.set("user_token", token, { httpOnly: true });
```

**Fix — JWT signature verify karo pehle (`jose` package use karo):**
```ts
import { NextRequest, NextResponse } from "next/server";
import { jwtVerify } from "jose";

export async function POST(request: NextRequest) {
  try {
    const { token } = await request.json();
    if (!token || typeof token !== "string") {
      return NextResponse.json({ error: "Token is required" }, { status: 400 });
    }

    // Pehle signature verify karo
    const secret = new TextEncoder().encode(process.env.JWT_SECRET);
    try {
      await jwtVerify(token, secret);
    } catch {
      return NextResponse.json({ error: "Invalid token" }, { status: 401 });
    }

    const response = NextResponse.json({ success: true });
    response.cookies.set("user_token", token, {
      httpOnly: true,
      secure: process.env.NODE_ENV === "production",
      sameSite: "lax",
      path: "/",
      maxAge: 7 * 24 * 60 * 60,
    });
    return response;
  } catch {
    return NextResponse.json({ error: "Internal server error" }, { status: 500 });
  }
}
```

> [!IMPORTANT]
> `JWT_SECRET` (non-`NEXT_PUBLIC_`) client `.env` mein add karo. `jose` install karo: `npm install jose`

