### F-011 — Medium: Password Minimum 6 Characters — Bahut Kam Hai

**SEVERITY:** Medium
**FILE:** `server/src/modules/auth/dto/register.dto.ts`
**LINE:** 32

**Masla (Roman Urdu):**
6 character ka password bahut weak hota hai. Aaj ke powerful computers ke saath 6-character password seconds mein crack ho sakta hai — chahe Argon2id use ho. Industry standard minimum 8 characters hai.

**Anjam (Consequences):**
