### F-014 — Medium: Raw Password Object Mein Pass Ho Raha Hai

**SEVERITY:** Medium
**FILE:** `server/src/modules/user/user.controller.ts`
**LINE:** 50-52

**Masla (Roman Urdu):**
Password change karte waqt plain text password ek object mein `userService.update()` ko pass kiya ja raha hai. `UserService` hash karta hai DB save se pehle — to database safe hai. Lekin agar kabhi NestJS debug logging enable ho to yeh object log mein aa sakta hai.

**Anjam (Consequences):**
- Debug mode mein logs mein plaintext password appear ho sakta hai
- Pattern risky hai — agar koi future developer logger add kare to security breach

**Current:**
```ts
