### F-032 — High: Asset Upload MIME Header Check Karta Hai — Magic Bytes Nahi

**SEVERITY:** High
**FILE:** `server/src/modules/assets/assets.service.ts`
**LINE:** 45-49

**Masla (Roman Urdu):**
Assets upload karte waqt file type sirf HTTP header se check hoti hai — jo completely attacker control karta hai. Agar koi `.exe` file `Content-Type: image/png` ke saath bheje, to yeh check pass kar jati hai.

**Anjam (Consequences):**
- Malicious files (viruses, scripts) server pe upload ho sakte hain
- Agar file serve ki jaye to users ko malware download ho sakta hai
- Server compromise possible hai

**Current (Vulnerable):**
```ts
if (!ALLOWED_MIME_TYPES.has(mimeType)) {  // mimeType = HTTP header = attacker-controlled
  throw new BadRequestException(...);
}
// .exe + Content-Type: image/png = PASS! Yeh galat hai
```

**Fix — Magic bytes validation add karo `assets.service.ts` mein:**
```ts
private validateMagicBytes(buffer: Buffer): boolean {
  if (!buffer || buffer.length < 12) return false;
  // JPEG: FF D8 FF
  if (buffer[0] === 0xff && buffer[1] === 0xd8 && buffer[2] === 0xff) return true;
  // PNG: 89 50 4E 47
  if (buffer[0] === 0x89 && buffer[1] === 0x50 && buffer[2] === 0x4e && buffer[3] === 0x47) return true;
  // WEBP: RIFF....WEBP
  if (buffer[0] === 0x52 && buffer[1] === 0x49 && buffer[2] === 0x46 && buffer[3] === 0x46 &&
      buffer[8] === 0x57 && buffer[9] === 0x45 && buffer[10] === 0x42 && buffer[11] === 0x50) return true;
  // SVG
  const start = buffer.toString('utf-8', 0, 5);
  if (start.startsWith('<?xml') || start.startsWith('<svg ')) return true;
  // MP4/MOV
  if (buffer.length >= 8) {
    const box = buffer.toString('ascii', 4, 8);
    if (['ftyp','moov','mdat','wide'].includes(box)) return true;
  }
  // WebM: 1A 45 DF A3
  if (buffer[0] === 0x1a && buffer[1] === 0x45 && buffer[2] === 0xdf && buffer[3] === 0xa3) return true;
  return false;
}

// uploadAsset() mein line 45 replace karo:
if (!ALLOWED_MIME_TYPES.has(mimeType) || !this.validateMagicBytes(buffer)) {
  throw new BadRequestException('Invalid or mismatched file type.');
}
```

