## Section 15 — Database Access

### F-037 — Medium: Database Connection Owner Role Se Hai

**SEVERITY:** Medium
**FILE:** `server/.env` line 6

**Masla (Roman Urdu):**
Database connection `neondb_owner` user se hai — yeh database ka **owner** hai. Iska matlab application ko `DROP TABLE`, `CREATE TABLE` jaise DDL permissions hain. Yeh kabhi nahi honi chahiye normal app operations ke liye.

**Anjam (Consequences):**
- Agar application hack ho jaye, attacker poora database drop kar sakta hai
- SQL injection (agar ho jaye) se complete database destroy ho sakti hai
- Accidental queries se critical tables delete ho sakte hain

**Fix — Restricted user banao Neon mein:**
```sql
CREATE USER edikit_app WITH PASSWORD '<strong-random-password>';
GRANT CONNECT ON DATABASE neondb TO edikit_app;
GRANT USAGE ON SCHEMA public TO edikit_app;
GRANT SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, DELETE ON ALL TABLES IN SCHEMA public TO edikit_app;
GRANT USAGE, SELECT ON ALL SEQUENCES IN SCHEMA public TO edikit_app;
-- DROP, CREATE, ALTER mat do
```
`DATABASE_URL` mein `edikit_app` use karo. `neondb_owner` sirf migrations ke liye.

