### F-043 — Medium: Account Delete Karte Waqt Session Invalidate Nahi Hoti

**SEVERITY:** Medium
**FILE:** `server/src/modules/user/user.controller.ts`
**LINE:** 57-68

**Masla (Roman Urdu):**
Account delete karte waqt `tokenVersion` increment nahi hota — sirf DB se user delete hota hai aur cookie clear hoti hai. In-flight requests technically error-prone ho sakte hain.

**Anjam (Consequences):**
- Agar delete ke waqt koi request in-flight ho to unpredictable behavior ho sakta hai
- Cleaner session invalidation best practice hai

**Current:**
```ts
await this.userService.delete(userId);
clearAuthCookie(res, this.configService);
// tokenVersion increment nahi hua
```

**Fix:**
```ts
@Delete('account')
async deleteAccount(@Request() req, @Response({ passthrough: true }) res) {
  const userId = req.user.userId;
  await this.authService.invalidateUserSessions(userId).catch(() => {});  // Pehle invalidate karo
  await this.userService.delete(userId);
  clearAuthCookie(res, this.configService);
  return { success: true, message: 'Account deleted successfully' };
}
```

